'''Akuma''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]].

