==Trivia==
*Akuma was the first [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] collab unit outside of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], which had [[Black Zeus (Legend Rare Cat)|Black Zeus]] before the other versions.
*Akuma and Black Zeus are the only Legend Rare Cats to produce normal souls when killed rather than turning into prismatic crystals.
*In all of Akuma's playable appearances in Street Fighter, he is a glass cannon, dealing more damage than most characters at a fast speed in exchange for usually being the lowest HP character in each game he appears in. This is reflected in his Battle Cats stats as well.

